w .12s ease,background .12s ease}.book-list a:hover{background:#eef7f0;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}h2.section-title{text-align:center;margin-top:32px;font-size:1.5rem;color:#0f5132}@media (max-width:600px){.hero h1{font-size:1.6rem}.hero p{font-size:1rem}.cta{width:100%;max-width:340px}}</style></head><body class=\\\"HDLmClass1b4f69d5\\\"><header class=\\\"hero HDLmClassc6158b43\\\"><h1>The Wizard of Oz Books by L. Frank Baum</h1><p>Read the complete Land of Oz series — all 14 classic novels plus the original play and short stories — free online, anytime, on any device.</p><a class=\\\"cta HDLmClasse480e9aa\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/01.htm\\\">Start Reading Free — Book 1: The Wonderful Wizard of Oz</a></header><main class=\\\"container\\\"><img class=\\\"hero-img\\\" src=\\\"https://themarvelouslandof.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/Wizard+of+Oz+-+The+Lion.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"The Cowardly Lion — classic Wizard of Oz illustration\\\"><h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">The Complete Oz Library</h2><nav class=\\\"book-list HDLmClass92991756\\\" aria-label=\\\"Oz book series\\\"><a class=\\\"HDLmClassc7624989\\\" href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/01.htm\\\">1. The Wonderful Wizard of Oz (1900)</a><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/OzPlay.pdf\\\">The Wizard of Oz: A Dramatic Composition (1902)</a><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/02.htm\\\">2. The Marvelous Land of Oz (1904)</a><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/03.htm\\\">3. Ozma of Oz (1907)</a><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/04.htm\\\">4. Dorothy and the Wizard in Oz (1908)</a><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/05.htm\\\">5. The Road to Oz (1909)</a><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/06.htm\\\">6. The Emerald City of Oz (1910)</a><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/07.htm\\\">7. The Patchwork Girl of Oz (1913)</a><a href=\\\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/08.htm\\\">Little Wizard Stories of Oz