0px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }\n  .book-list li a { display: block; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d8e5da; border-left: 5px solid #17864a; border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; text-decoration: none; color: #2c3e2d; font-size: 1.02em; transition: background 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease; }\n  .book-list li a:hover { background: #eefaf1; border-left-color: #f5c518; }\n  .book-list .book-year { display: block; font-size: 0.85em; color: #6b7d6e; }\n  footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px 16px; font-size: 0.9em; color: #6b7d6e; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"hero HDLmClassee8a0624\">\n  <h1>The Wizard of Oz Books by L. Frank Baum</h1>\n  <p>Read all 14 original Oz books completely free online &mdash; from Dorothy's first trip down the yellow brick road to Glinda of Oz. No sign-up, no downloads, just classic stories.</p>\n  <a href=\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/01.htm\" class=\"cta-button HDLmClass37ff73e\">Start Reading Book 1 Free &raquo;</a>\n  <img src=\"https://themarvelouslandof.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/Wizard+of+Oz+-+The+Lion.jpg\" alt=\"The Cowardly Lion illustration from The Wizard of Oz by L. Frank Baum\" class=\"hero-image HDLmClass80b27afa\" width=\"600\">\n</header>\n<main>\n  <h2>The Complete Oz Book Series</h2>\n  <ul class=\"book-list HDLmClassffafaf60\">\n    <li><a href=\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/01.htm\" class=\"HDLmClass583c6166\">1. The Wonderful Wizard of Oz <span class=\"book-year\">(1900)</span></a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/OzPlay.pdf\">The Wizard of Oz: A Dramatic Composition <span class=\"book-year\">(1902)</span></a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/02.htm\">2. The Marvelous Land of Oz <span class=\"book-year\">(1904)</span></a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/03.htm\">3. Ozma of Oz <span class=\"book-year\">(1907)</span></a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://themarvelouslandofoz.com/04.htm\">4. Dorothy and the Wizard in 