 original simple page with an image and links, planning out the head section with title and meta description.\n\nI'm assigning tracking classes throughout: viewport meta gets HDLmClass4cb7119d, a hero section with headline and CTA gets HDLmClass478b79bf, book list cards get HDLmClass850e6f6b, a typo fix gets HDLmClasse1e0d197, and an email signup form gets HDLmClass5766e359. Writing the HTML structure...\n\nWriting HTML markup...\n\nAdding styles for the CTA button and book list grid...\n\nStill writing markup...\n\nAdding more book entries...\n\nContinuing through the rest of the Oz series: Rinkitink in Oz, Lost Princess, Tin Woodman, Magic of Oz, and Glinda of Oz round out the fourteen books.\n\nNow I'm compiling the improvements list — viewport meta tag for mobile usability, fixing the Wizard typo for trust, adding a hero headline and CTA to boost engagement, and starting to note styling changes as well.\n\nI'm finishing the improvements list with the card-style book layout for easier navigation, an email signup form to capture leads, and an SEO meta description to improve search traffic, then preparing to output everything as a single JSON line with escaped newlines in the HTML.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":1,"signature":""},{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Now that I have the homepage content, I'll put together the improved HTML along with the list of improvements using the hashes I already computed.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":2,"signature":""}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":95561,"completion_tokens":21660,"total_tokens":117221,"cost":2.03861,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":2.03861,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.95561,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":1.083},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":18415,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"server_tool_use_details":{"web_search_requests":0}}}
